<title>FRANCE: French February coffee imports rose yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French February coffee imports rose yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in February issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		   Feb 97    Feb 96    Jan-Feb 97    Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>Ivory Coast    1,877     2,751	3,400	    5,353</p>
<p>Cameroon	   239	 677	  651	    1,034</p>
<p>Brazil	   5,068     3,347     11,632	    7,549</p>
<p>Colombia	 2,654     3,187	5,673	    6,875</p>
<p>World total   28,796    26,783     58,042	   52,147</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
